From 3d22f934a0e597e2341f5576017a84a5a8481ecb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 05:46:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] chronik: native group engine and script, LOKAD id and txid
 groups
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add the Extension/GroupDef interface (design §5.3, the port of Rust's
Group trait) and the group engine of io/group_history.rs and
io/group_utxos.rs: paged history with the scripthash member index, and
UTXO sets in both dup encodings (fixed 20-byte values, and outpoint ‖
sats ‖ raw script for groups that need the output). Dup writes are
buffered per call like the Rust write batch, so an output created and
spent in the same block never reaches the table.

Port groups/{script,lokad_id,txid}.rs on top of it. Token-id grouping
comes with the token index.

Tests: 11 cases (Rust has 3 for these modules).

Tier: eCash
